WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.234
-Finally everybody,
it is Tuesday.

00:00:02.234 --> 00:00:04.267
It is time for "WePost."
Here we go.

00:00:04.267 --> 00:00:07.934
-♪ WePost ♪

00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:11.467
♪ WePost ♪

00:00:11.467 --> 00:00:13.434
-Welcome to "WePost."

00:00:13.434 --> 00:00:14.868
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.868 --> 00:00:18.334
This is where we

00:00:18.334 --> 00:00:23.634
as a group decide something
that we should post on socials.

00:00:23.634 --> 00:00:25.300
I'm going to show you
five different posts,

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:26.300
and we're all going to vote

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:27.667
on whether you like
each one or not.

00:00:27.667 --> 00:00:29.734
You all have voting clickers
at your seats.

00:00:29.734 --> 00:00:31.801
There's green for yes,
red for no.

00:00:31.801 --> 00:00:33.701
You can vote for all of them.
You can vote for none of them.

00:00:33.701 --> 00:00:36.901
Whatever you want. We're going
to see the results live.

00:00:36.901 --> 00:00:38.634
Higgins, Roots,
you have your clickers too?

00:00:38.634 --> 00:00:39.968
-Ready?
-Yep. Tariq, are you

00:00:39.968 --> 00:00:42.834
in a positive mood this evening?
-I mean, it depends.

00:00:42.834 --> 00:00:45.234
Like, once you start reading
them posts, then we'll see.

00:00:45.234 --> 00:00:46.434
-Yeah.

00:00:46.434 --> 00:00:47.801
Okay, here we go.

00:00:47.801 --> 00:00:49.834
Tonight I will post whichever
one gets the most likes

00:00:49.834 --> 00:00:51.901
from all of us
because it's not a MePost.

00:00:51.901 --> 00:00:54.033
No, no, no, it is a WePost.

00:00:54.033 --> 00:00:57.033
[ Crowd cheers ]

00:00:57.033 --> 00:00:58.868
Alright. Ready?
The first post is...

00:01:03.667 --> 00:01:06.701
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:06.701 --> 00:01:10.033
I'll just do --
Eh, I'll go -- I'll lift it up.

00:01:10.033 --> 00:01:12.300
Let me go all the way
underneath.

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:13.801
Alright, here we go.
I think this one's going to be

00:01:13.801 --> 00:01:15.400
a little bit better, though,
I don't know.

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:16.501
Let me see this one.

00:01:17.634 --> 00:01:19.200
Alright. Hey, that's not bad.

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:21.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:21.434 --> 00:01:22.534
-There you go.
-I don't know

00:01:22.534 --> 00:01:24.267
if we're in posting levels yet,

00:01:24.267 --> 00:01:25.434
but that one's better than --

00:01:25.434 --> 00:01:26.767
-That one's better than
the last one.

00:01:26.767 --> 00:01:28.567
-Yeah.
-Twice as much.

00:01:28.567 --> 00:01:30.868
-Tariq is just not
speaking at all.

00:01:30.868 --> 00:01:32.501
He's just lost.
-I mean, here's the thing.

00:01:32.501 --> 00:01:34.634
Respectfully,
I haven't cared for one yet.

00:01:34.634 --> 00:01:37.234
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.234 --> 00:01:39.534
-When you said respectfully
and then insulted me,

00:01:39.534 --> 00:01:41.133
what -- did you want me to --

00:01:41.133 --> 00:01:42.501
-I wanted to take the edge off.

00:01:42.501 --> 00:01:43.767
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.767 --> 00:01:44.934
-It worked. It worked.

00:01:44.934 --> 00:01:47.567
I kind of thought
that was respectful. Thanks.

00:01:47.567 --> 00:01:48.868
This next one here says...

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:56.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.033 --> 00:01:57.300
A little dippity doo.

00:01:57.300 --> 00:02:01.067
-[ Squelching ]

00:02:02.501 --> 00:02:03.968
-Alright, let's see
the results here.

00:02:03.968 --> 00:02:05.400
Hair in the '90s?

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:07.100
Hey, not bad!
Now we're talking!

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:10.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:10.033 --> 00:02:12.601
Now we're talking.
Now I'm seeing something.

00:02:12.601 --> 00:02:14.501
Tariq's got a little --
He's got a little smile.

00:02:14.501 --> 00:02:15.901
-Been like a ladder.
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:02:15.901 --> 00:02:18.200
-This one's a little better.
-Yeah, I think this next one

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:19.667
might be the one.
-Really?

00:02:19.667 --> 00:02:21.400
-Yeah. I have a feeling.
I could see it right now

00:02:21.400 --> 00:02:23.400
on the cue cards,
and I think this might be it.

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:25.167
-Let's do it.
-Alright. Here we go.

00:02:25.167 --> 00:02:26.267
It says...

00:02:30.467 --> 00:02:32.000
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:33.901
Just kind of sticks in there.

00:02:33.901 --> 00:02:35.467
Just kind of stays in there
and you go, "Oh, yeah."

00:02:35.467 --> 00:02:37.000
-Just love it.
-There you go.

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:39.667
That's my -- Out
of all the molasses candies,

00:02:39.667 --> 00:02:42.367
all the molasses
chewable candies,

00:02:42.367 --> 00:02:45.133
Bit-O-Honey is up there.
-It's definitely up there.

00:02:45.133 --> 00:02:46.767
-Let's see the results here.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:49.300
-Ooh!

00:02:50.267 --> 00:02:52.300
-Wow.

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:53.601
-Alright, might be
the other one,

00:02:53.601 --> 00:02:55.667
but I think it's going
to be this one.

00:02:55.667 --> 00:02:57.000
-They said, "Thank you, no."
-This one,

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:59.267
I'm not only -- I'm saying
it's going to be this one,

00:02:59.267 --> 00:03:01.133
but this one might even
get a standing ovation.

00:03:01.133 --> 00:03:04.133
-Really? It's that good?
-I don't know if it's that good.

00:03:04.133 --> 00:03:06.667
I just feel like the audience
wants to stand up.

00:03:06.667 --> 00:03:09.000
-Yeah. Seventh inning stretch.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:11.300
-Maybe we could see --
It's made me laugh.

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:12.467
This made me laugh.
-This one made you laugh.

00:03:12.467 --> 00:03:13.734
-It made me laugh in rehearsal.
And yeah.

00:03:13.734 --> 00:03:15.534
-Okay.
-So I think this is the one.

00:03:15.534 --> 00:03:17.167
If I could take
all my votes back

00:03:17.167 --> 00:03:20.133
and add it all to this,
I would do it.

00:03:20.133 --> 00:03:21.300
I'm going to press it now
just in case.

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:24.000
-Oh, my gosh.
It's called the prequel.

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:25.467
-I don't know
if it even works right now.

00:03:25.467 --> 00:03:26.834
-Yeah.
-But I'm going to do that

00:03:26.834 --> 00:03:29.834
just in case they turn
the computers on now.

00:03:29.834 --> 00:03:31.501
Alright. The last one says...

00:03:34.501 --> 00:03:36.634
[ Laughter ]

00:03:36.634 --> 00:03:39.067
Not bad, not bad.

00:03:39.067 --> 00:03:43.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:43.067 --> 00:03:44.367
-Wow.

00:03:44.367 --> 00:03:45.767
-I feel good about this.
-Standing ovation.

00:03:45.767 --> 00:03:47.901
-If we win, do we get
a standing ovation?

00:03:47.901 --> 00:03:49.133
Let's see the results.

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:52.434
Booyah! Come on, get up!
[ Dinging ]

00:03:52.434 --> 00:03:54.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:59.901
♪♪

00:03:59.901 --> 00:04:02.334
Oh!

00:04:02.334 --> 00:04:03.534
Guys, you nailed it.

00:04:03.534 --> 00:04:05.701
Looks like the winner
is mannequin right there.

00:04:05.701 --> 00:04:07.300
I'm going to post this
during the break.

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:10.200
If you happen to see it online,
give that WePost a repost.

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:11.300
We have a great show.

